.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt WHOAMI 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm whoami
.Nd print the effective user name
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the account name for the effective uid.
If the account database has no record for that uid, it prints the numeric uid and exits 1.
.Pp
The kernel is root-only in 0.2.0, so
.Nm
prints
.Ql root .
U3 supplies the real effective uid.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/passwd -compact
.It Pa /etc/passwd
account records
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr id 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
